The Tale of the Three Northern 
Territories Conference</b>

00:14:48.440 --> 00:14:54.170
Next time on "Isekai Izakaya"
aka "Izakaya Nobu in Aitheria."

00:14:54.500 --> 00:14:57.500
Please sample the tasty tales.
